# On Sabbatical (crystalWar 32), the Progress rival against the rest of the Gentle Tiger states: a level 99 Warrior in
# Bastok Markets [S] with On Sabbatical accepted at Prog 1 (a GM: 47, a Progress, repeatable) and the WotG mission
# Adieu, Lilisette current (GMs). Each state below is set by a GM (the quest accepted, its Prog, a key item where the
# state needs one) and talked to twice: an Event loses to 47 both times (47, 47), a Progress alternates with it (47,
# then the Progress). The Progress states shown: Light in the Darkness Prog 6 (27), Quelling the Storm Prog 2 (181)
# and 5 (184), Honor under Fire Prog 4 without the Flare Grenade (70) and Prog 6 (71), Beneath the Mask Prog 5 (347),
# What Price Loyalty Prog 4 without the Commander's Endorsement (357) and Prog 6 (350). The Event states shown, as 47
# twice: Light Prog 1-4 and 7, Burden of Suspicion Prog 0, Quelling Prog 3, 4, 6 and 7, Honor Prog 1, 3 and 4 with the
# Flare Grenade, Beneath the Mask Prog 0, 3, 4 (the Wax Seal) and 6, What Price Loyalty Prog 0 (the Sack of Victuals),
# 3 and 4 with the Endorsement. What Price Loyalty completed (an Event) ends the flow: 47, then The Truth Lies Hid's
# offer 211 (it became available), so the Event is not shown there.
lists BastokMarketsS/Gentle_Tiger/onTrigger
char zone=BastokMarketsS pos=-202.432,-9.998,2.237 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning completed
mission Wotg AdieuLilisette current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
